{%- set f = passFree -%}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>All Access pass | AK Explained</title>
<meta name="description" content="The All Access pass opens every test on AK Explained that is not free: mock tests, MCQ practice sets and previous-year papers. See what is free, what the pass adds, the price, and pay with Razorpay.">
<link rel="icon" href="/assets/logo.png" type="image/png">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Literata:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;0,700;1,400&family=Source+Sans+3:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/site.css">
</head>
<body>
<a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a>

<header class="site-header"></header>

<div class="wrap"><p class="crumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span>All Access pass</p></div>
<main id="main" class="passpage">

{# CLAUDE.md rule 22. Free numbers come from _data/passFree.js (the site's own files, at build time). Paid numbers
   come from the live paper_catalog in the browser (assets/pass.js), because paid papers are added self-serve. #}

<section class="pass-hero">
  <div class="wrap pass-hero-grid">
    <div class="pass-hero-copy">
      <p class="pass-badge">All Access pass</p>
      <h1>Every test on AK Explained, with one pass</h1>
      <p class="pass-hero-lede">Mock tests, MCQ practice sets and previous-year papers for UP PGT, UP Assistant Professor and UGC NET English, all opened by a single payment. Everything that is free today stays free.</p>
      <ul class="pass-ticks">
        <li>Every paid test opens the moment you pay, with answers and explanations</li>
        <li>New tests are added to the pass as they are published</li>
        <li>No automatic renewal: the pass simply ends when its days are over</li>
        <li>Your dashboard and progress stay free, with or without a pass</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="pass-stats" aria-label="The pass at a glance">
        <div><b data-paid-total-papers>&ndash;</b><span>paid tests</span></div>
        <div><b data-paid-total-q>&ndash;</b><span>questions</span></div>
        <div><b data-paid-series>&ndash;</b><span>test series</span></div>
      </div>
      <p class="pass-trust">Secure payment by Razorpay &middot; UPI, cards, netbanking and wallets</p>
    </div>

    <aside class="pass-buy" id="passCard" aria-labelledby="passTitle">
      <div id="passNotice" class="authnotice" role="status">Loading the pass&hellip;</div>
      <section id="passMine" class="pass-mine" hidden></section>

      <section id="passBuy" hidden>
        <h2 id="passTitle">All Access pass</h2>
        <p id="passDesc" class="small muted"></p>
        <p class="passprice"><strong id="passPrice"></strong> <span class="muted">for every <span id="passDays">30</span> days</span></p>

        <form id="passForm" novalidate>
          <label class="field">
            <span>How long</span>
            <select id="passUnits"></select>
          </label>

          <div class="passpromo">
            <label class="field">
              <span>Promo code (if you have one)</span>
              <input id="passCode" type="text" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="characters" maxlength="30" spellcheck="false">
            </label>
            <button id="passApply" class="btn alt" type="button">Apply</button>
          </div>
          <p id="passCodeMsg" class="small" role="status" hidden></p>

          <dl class="passsum">
            <div><dt>Price</dt><dd id="sumBase">&mdash;</dd></div>
            <div id="sumDiscRow" hidden><dt>Promo discount</dt><dd id="sumDisc">&mdash;</dd></div>
            <div class="passsum-total"><dt>To pay</dt><dd id="sumTotal">&mdash;</dd></div>
          </dl>

          <div class="formerror" id="passError" role="alert" hidden></div>
          <button id="passGo" class="btn pass-cta" type="submit" data-auth-only hidden>Pay and open the pass</button>
          <a id="passLogin" class="btn pass-cta" href="/login/?next=%2Fpass%2F" data-guest-only>Log in to buy the pass</a>
          <p class="small muted pass-fine">By paying you agree to the <a href="/terms/">Terms</a> and the <a href="/refund-policy/">Refund Policy</a>.</p>
        </form>
      </section>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>





<section class="pass-sec">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="pass-sec-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Free or with the pass</p>
      <h2>What you get, side by side</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="pass-cmp-wrap">
      <table class="pass-cmp">
        <thead>
          <tr><th scope="col">What</th><th scope="col">Free</th><th scope="col">With the pass</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><th scope="row">Articles and notes on English literature</th><td class="y" data-label="Free">All</td><td class="y" data-label="With the pass">All</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">Daily quiz</th><td class="y" data-label="Free">{{ f.daily.ages }} ages, {{ f.daily.questions }} questions</td><td class="y" data-label="With the pass">The same</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">English Literature MCQ practice sets</th><td class="y" data-label="Free">{{ f.sets.count }} sets, {{ f.sets.questions }} questions</td><td class="y" data-label="With the pass">The free sets, plus <span data-cmp="lit-sets">the paid sets</span></td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">UP PGT English mock tests</th><td class="y" data-label="Free">{{ f.pgtMock.count }} tests, {{ f.pgtMock.questions }} questions</td><td class="y" data-label="With the pass">The free tests, plus <span data-cmp="pgt-mock">the paid tests</span></td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">UP PGT English MCQ days</th><td class="y" data-label="Free">{{ f.pgtDays.count }} days, {{ f.pgtDays.questions }} questions</td><td class="y" data-label="With the pass">The free days, plus <span data-cmp="pgt-days">the paid days</span></td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">UP Assistant Professor Paper 2 mock tests</th><td class="n" data-label="Free">None</td><td class="y" data-label="With the pass"><span data-cmp="ap-mock">All the tests</span></td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">UGC NET English previous-year papers</th><td class="y" data-label="Free">{{ f.netPyq.count }} papers ({{ f.netPyq.years }}), {{ f.netPyq.questions }} questions</td><td class="y" data-label="With the pass">The free papers, plus <span data-cmp="net-pyq">the paid papers</span></td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">Answers, explanations and review after each test</th><td class="y" data-label="Free">On every free test</td><td class="y" data-label="With the pass">On every test</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">Dashboard, progress and top students list</th><td class="y" data-label="Free">Yes, with a free account</td><td class="y" data-label="With the pass">Yes</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="pass-sec pass-sec-tint">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="pass-sec-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Inside the pass</p>
      <h2>What the pass opens today</h2>
      <p class="muted">These numbers are read live from the site, so they grow as new tests are published.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pass-inv" id="passInv">
      <a class="pass-inv-card" href="/exams/pgt/up-pgt/mock-tests/" data-grp="pgt-mock">
        <span class="pass-inv-num" data-n>&ndash;</span>
        <span class="pass-inv-name">UP PGT English mock tests</span>
        <span class="pass-inv-q" data-q></span>
      </a>
      <a class="pass-inv-card" href="/exams/state-psc/up-assistant-professor/paper-2-mock-tests/" data-grp="ap-mock">
        <span class="pass-inv-num" data-n>&ndash;</span>
        <span class="pass-inv-name">UP Assistant Professor Paper 2 mock tests</span>
        <span class="pass-inv-q" data-q></span>
      </a>
      <a class="pass-inv-card" href="/exams/pgt/up-pgt/mcqs/" data-grp="pgt-days">
        <span class="pass-inv-num" data-n>&ndash;</span>
        <span class="pass-inv-name">UP PGT English MCQ days</span>
        <span class="pass-inv-q" data-q></span>
      </a>
      <a class="pass-inv-card" href="/exams/net/english-pyqs/" data-grp="net-pyq">
        <span class="pass-inv-num" data-n>&ndash;</span>
        <span class="pass-inv-name">UGC NET English previous-year papers</span>
        <span class="pass-inv-q" data-q></span>
      </a>
      <a class="pass-inv-card" href="/quizzes/mcq/" data-grp="lit-sets">
        <span class="pass-inv-num" data-n>&ndash;</span>
        <span class="pass-inv-name">English Literature MCQ practice sets</span>
        <span class="pass-inv-q" data-q></span>
      </a>
    </div>
    <p class="small muted" id="passInvNote">Open any card to see the tests on that page.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="pass-sec">
  <div class="wrap pass-faq">
    <div class="pass-sec-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Questions</p>
      <h2>Before you pay</h2>
    </div>
    <details><summary>How long does the pass last?</summary><p>Each period is <span data-plan-days>30</span> days. You can buy several periods at once, and the total is shown before you pay.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Does it renew on its own?</summary><p>No. The pass ends when its days are over, and you are never charged again unless you buy again.</p></details>
    <details><summary>What if I buy again while my pass is running?</summary><p>The new days start when your current pass ends, so you lose no day.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Will tests added later be included?</summary><p>Yes. Any test that needs the pass opens for you while your pass runs, including tests published after you pay.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Can I get a refund?</summary><p>If you have not opened any paid test, ask within 24 hours of paying for a full refund. Failed, wrongly taken and double payments are always returned. The full rules are in the <a href="/refund-policy/">Refund Policy</a>.</p></details>
    <details><summary>The money was taken but the pass did not open. What now?</summary><p>Wait a few minutes and open this page again: the pass usually opens on its own. If it still has not, write from the <a href="/contact/">Contact page</a> with the date of the payment, and it will be opened or the money returned.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Do I lose my progress if my pass ends?</summary><p>No. Your answers, results and dashboard stay with your account.</p></details>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="pass-sec pass-sec-tint pass-sec-last">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="pass-sec-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">How it works</p>
      <h2>Three steps to start</h2>
    </div>
    <ol class="pass-steps">
      <li><span class="pass-step-n">1</span><h3>Log in</h3><p>Use your free AK Explained account, or make one in a minute.</p></li>
      <li><span class="pass-step-n">2</span><h3>Choose and pay</h3><p>Pick how many days, add a promo code if you have one, and pay with Razorpay.</p></li>
      <li><span class="pass-step-n">3</span><h3>Start practising</h3><p>Every paid test opens at once. Your pass dates are shown on this page.</p></li>
    </ol>
    <p class="pass-steps-cta"><a class="btn" href="#passCard">See the price and get the pass</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

</main>

<footer class="site-footer"></footer>

<script src="/assets/pass.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
